title: Railroads on Strike! 
new-page: true
view-if: vikzhel_unrest >= 50 and vikzhel_strength >= 25 and coalition_government < 1 and railroad_strike_seen != 1
tags: event
on-arrival: {!
    Q.vikzhel_strike = 1;
    Q.workers_unrest += 10;
    Q.railroad_strike_seen = 1;

    Q.previous_military_trains = Q.military_trains;
    Q.military_trains *= 0.1;
    Q.ag_transport *= 0.9;

    window.indShock('rail_strike', 0.35, 'manufacturing');
    window.indShock('rail_strike_yards', 0.5, 'transportation');
!}

= Railroad Strike

The All-Russian Union of Railway Workers (**Vikzhel**) has declared that they are launching their promised railroad strike! Railway workers across the country are refusing to work, bringing our industry to a standstill. 
